{"id":"1aa3c999691b","path":"/it/education/master/interreligious-dialogue/career-prospects","lang":"it","title":"Career Prospects","description":"","section":"Education","crumbs":["Education","Master","MID"],"image":null,"words":77,"alternates":{"it":"/it/education/master/interreligious-dialogue/career-prospects","en":"/en/education/master/interreligious-dialogue/career-prospects"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Education","path":"/en/originalnode/8525"},{"label":"Master","path":"/en/originalnode/7757"},{"label":"MID","path":"/en/education/master/interreligious-dialogue"},{"label":"Career Prospects","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>The master's program in Interreligious Dialogue equips students with valuable skills and knowledge for various career paths related to interfaith relations. Graduates can pursue opportunities in:</p> <ul> <li>Academic research, focusing on interreligious studies and promoting understanding between different religious communities.</li> <li>Roles in communication, cultural mediation, journalism, and specialized positions in the fields of geopolitics and international relations. The acquired expertise in interreligious dialogue and understanding different cultural contexts makes graduates highly sought-after professionals in an increasingly interconnected world.</li> </ul>"}],"ctas":[{"label":"Apply Now","href":"/en/education-application"}],"nav":[{"label":"Overview","href":"/en/education/master/interreligious-dialogue"},{"label":"Why this Master","href":"/en/education/master/interreligious-dialogue/why-this-master"},{"label":"Study plan","href":"/en/education/master/interreligious-dialogue/structure-and-contents"},{"label":"Career Prospects","href":"/en/education/master/interreligious-dialogue/career-prospects"},{"label":"Application and admission","href":"/en/education/master/interreligious-dialogue/admission"},{"label":"News","href":"/en/education/master/interreligious-dialogue/news"},{"label":"Fees an